  "text": "Other than when you show up to physically purchase the valuable metal you discover that the physical rate differs from all of the area costs you have actually been tracking. An area cost is a cost that is a composite of multiple forces, pulling together futures markets purchasing and offering contracts. Another factor while the physical price is different than the area price are the several steps that a precious metal takes before physically showing up in your hands. Do you comprehend the difference in between spot rates and physical costs?\nA spot price is a price that is a composite of numerous forces, pulling together futures markets purchasing and offering agreements. Another factor while the physical rate is different than the area cost are the numerous steps that a valuable metal takes before physically getting here in your hands. Do you understand the difference in between spot costs and physical rates?\nYou have print outs for gold, print outs for silver, and every area rate for every valuable metal in between. Except when you arrive to physically buy the valuable metal you find that the physical rate varies from all of the area prices you have actually been tracking.\nbulliontrading\nView all posts\nPrevious Post\nHow Much Gold Is There on Earth?\nNext Post\nWhat Are Art Bars?",
